1a:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Many grammar errors are harmless: a listener understands and moves on. A smaller set genuinely changes the message, and those are worth your attention first. Tense places events in time, modals signal how firm you are being, and articles sometimes change which thing you mean."}]
