1c:["$","div","3",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-400","children":[false,"The last two rows are the ones that cause real trouble at work. \"I will work Saturday\" is a commitment. \"I could work Saturday\" or \"I would work Saturday if you need me\" is an offer. Supervisors act on the first, so use it only when you mean it."]}]
